<title>UK: ICI Pakistan signs $25 mln loan facility.</title>
<headline>ICI Pakistan signs $25 mln loan facility.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICI Pakistan Ltd has signed a $25 million loan agreement with a group of Pakistani and international banks, said loan arranger HSBC Investment Banking.</p>
<p>The facility completes the offshore funding requirement for ICI Pakistan Ltd's Pure Terephthalic Acid plant currently being built at Port Qasim near Karachi.</p>
<p>The facility is in addition to the $172 million UK export credit that ICI Pakistan Ltd signed earlier this year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
